OL,3,GNEWSAIsland firms held back by banking
OL,4,Agap, group says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses in Guernsey, Jersey and the
OL,7,FIsle of Man are being asked to share
OL,8,Ftheir experiences of digital banking
OL,9,Famid claims they are being left behind
OL,10,Fby services available elsewhere.
OL,12,FInnovate Guernsey launched the Crown
OL,13,FDependencies Digital Banking Survey
OL,14,Fafter businesses reported difficulties
OL,15,Faccessing bank accounts, payment
OL,16,Fplatforms and other digital financial
OL,17,Fservices.
